{"title":"Flowers","slug":"Flowers","pageid":2606,"revid":21644,"timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:44:13Z","lastEditor":"Matheo12wrc","categories":["Resources"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"N/A"},{"label":"Price","value":"N/A"},{"label":"Function","value":"To make dye."},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.54.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"flowers","text":"Flowers"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p>Flowers are a randomly spawned Loose item that spawn on the ground or bushes, there are rare variants of the flowers which have a chance of spawning.\n</p><p>When placed in a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Press_Machine/\">Press Machine</a> along with an empty jar, flowers will be turned into their corresponding dye. Dyes can be applied to certain items by using a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dye_Machine/\">Dye Machine</a>, or sold for 4x the base price of their respective flower.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"flowers\">Flowers</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Flower\n</th>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Flower Value\n</th>\n<th>Dye\n</th>\n<th>Dye Value\n</th>\n<th>Locations\n</th>\n<th>Other notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Tulip/\">Red Tulip</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red Tulip\">Red Tulip</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$25\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red Tulip Dye\">Red Tulip Dye</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Orange_Tulip/\">Orange Tulip</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Orange Tulip\">Orange Tulip</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$25\n</td>\n