 href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Oak/\">Oak</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Birch/\">Birch</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Birch/\">Red Birch</a> trees on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupted_tumbleweed/\">Corrupted tumbleweed</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Corrupted Tumbleweed1.png\">Corrupted Tumbleweed1.png</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Corrupted Tumbleweed1.png\">Corrupted Tumbleweed1.png</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$95\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Corrupted tumbleweed jar\">Corrupted tumbleweed jar</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Corrupted tumbleweed jar\">Corrupted tumbleweed jar</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$380\n</td>\n<td>Corrupt the normal <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tumbleweed/\">Tumbleweed</a> using  <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms/\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>' spore\n</td>\n<td>It may seems impossible to put it into the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Press_Machine/\">Press Machine</a> due to it's large size. but using the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alignment_Conveyor/\">Alignment Conveyor</a>, it would work as intended.\n<p>When selling it to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jer_Junkman/\">Jer Junkman</a>, he will say you can sell it for snowflakes. This might be a bug or under looked forgotten content from the developers of the game.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE_